# vcr datadirtesting (plan Task 11) — secrets.json and any per-test secrets file must never be
# committed. `source/data/in/` is deliberately NOT ignored here (unlike the generic
# keboola.datadirtest boilerplate): this is a *writer* component, so `in/tables/`/`in/files/`
# hold the real input fixtures the component uploads — VCR only mocks the HTTP layer, not the
# filesystem, so replay needs those files physically present and committed.
secrets.json
tests/functional/*/source/data/config.secrets.json
tests/functional/*/source/data/out/
